    "created_at": "2016-06-25T14:36:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-25T14:37:09Z",
    "body": "I'm assuming this isn't available yet to detect available bitrates on native HLS and make it selectable ? Also an event for bitrate change. \n\nThere is no way it seems to detect what the video dimension is internally. \"videoWidth\" is never updated there is a resize event in webkit though. \n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
